ion and finally  topping it off with the white mane  Lionel otherwise known as the I'm just  gonna go that way but they're not  indestructible in fact a well-placed  arrow to the face will stun any Lionel  long enough for you to get some solid  hits in and if you got your upgrades  stasis room you can actually freeze them  in place before you unload a half a  dozen arrows into his skull stunning the  Lionel with the hedgehog will also allow  you to climb aboard his rear end and  attack him there the attacks you do  while mounting them will deal full  damage as well as causing no durability  loss to your weapons so equipped  whatever massive blade you've got in  your bag and swing away  so those are some of our best practices  when it comes to the mini-bosses in  breath of the wild I hope this video  makes your life in the game a little  less prone to death but if you've got  any tips for tackling these beasts  including the fabled Silvermane Lionel  please let me know in the comments below  and don't forget to subscribe to the  GameSpot YouTube channel for even more  coverage of breath of the wild  [Music]  [Music]

